WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Put the words in order. The subject is she, and to eat breakfast is have breakfast.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.100
“have” fails with she: in the third person it becomes has. “in” fails because the time takes at.

3
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:22.100
“She has breakfast at eight.”
